{"widgets":[{"height":3,"properties":{"markdown":"## Cost and capacity\nEstimated model cost is emitted only when usage and a pricing row both exist. A missing point is unknown, not zero. A budget alarm is not a spending cap. See docs/OBSERVABILITY.md for the assumptions."},"type":"text","width":24,"x":0,"y":0},{"height":6,"properties":{"metrics":[[{"expression":"SUM(SEARCH('{VirtuSP,Environment,Service,Provider,ModelAlias} MetricName=\"EstimatedModelCostMicroUsd\" Environment=\"production\"', 'Sum', 60))","id":"c","label":"Estimated micro-USD"}]],"region":"us-west-2","title":"Estimated model cost (micro-USD)"},"type":"metric","width":12,"x":0,"y":3},{"height":6,"properties":{"metrics":[[{"expression":"SUM(SEARCH('{VirtuSP,Environment,Service} MetricName=\"TelemetryHeartbeat\" Environment=\"production\"', 'Sum', 60))","id":"h","label":"Heartbeat"}]],"region":"us-west-2","title":"Telemetry heartbeat as a freshness check"},"type":"metric","width":12,"x":12,"y":3},{"height":4,"properties":{"markdown":"## AWS running cost\nUnblended Cost Explorer charges for this stack, in USD. **Hour** is the latest complete UTC hour. **Day** is the latest complete UTC day. **Week** is the last seven complete UTC days. **Month** and **year** are calendar to date and include today. The numbers and bars are the latest sample. The line is each hour. Charges are resources tagged `Project=virtusp`, plus Amazon Bedrock in this account. Until that cost-allocation tag is active, the sample uses this stack's service names instead. If hourly Cost Explorer data is off, the hour is that day divided by 24. Cost Explorer can lag. This is account billing, not a model price estimate."},"type":"text","width":24,"x":0,"y":9},{"height":4,"properties":{"end":"-PT0M","metrics":[["VirtuSP/AwsCost","CostUsd","Project","virtusp","Period","Hour",{"label":"Hour"}],["VirtuSP/AwsCost","CostUsd","Project","virtusp","Period","Day",{"label":"Day"}],["VirtuSP/AwsCost","CostUsd","Project","virtusp","Period","Week",{"l